  listOfAdvices:
  - The eye in the water blinked.
  - Fish don't normally leave footprints.
  - Something keeps rearranging the buoys at night.
  - You counted six fish. Why are there seven shadows?
  - The lake wasn't this deep yesterday.
  - The angler closes at midnight but the lights stay on until dawn.
  - Lake isn't scary,ocean is
  - Some catches are heavier than they should be.
  - A fish with human teeth is perfectly normal.
  - The thing beneath the dock isn't a fish.
  - Don't fish where the water whispers.
  - Nobody knows who rings the bell offshore.
  - +luck for next fish
  - The abyss fish was discovered before the abyss
  - The fish can smell fear. Luckily, they can't smell through the screen.
  - Sun reacts on the rarity,how does it help?
  - The moon fish only appears at night. Probably.
  - If you hear knocking underwater, ignore it.
  - Fish don't pay taxes. Must be nice.
  - Insanity or delusions?
  - Angler can sell good stuff!
  - The bigger the fish the pricier it is
  - rarity doesn't affect price
  - quality over quantity
  - Why fish is ungramatical? guess
  - You made even the devil cry!
  - fish are talking because they had enough
  - fish can be big in size,but light in weight
  - Better rod-better fish
  - Better rod doesn't affect rarity of fish
